@PrintDebateText Text:集まる前はみなさん、<br>何をしてたんですのー！？|#0202Trial10_Hanna001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR-Option-Off,ArmR2,ArmL6,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Closed,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Surprised_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:ラウンジには<br>わがはいとレイアがいた。|#0202Trial10_AnAn001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.ArmL5,Angle01/ArmR-,Eyes1_Normal_Open2,Mouth1_Surprised_Open1
